{
  "name": "AI RFQ-to-Quote Automator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎯 AI RFQ-TO-QUOTE AUTOMATOR\n**What it does:** RFQ PDF upload via n8n form → AI extracts line items (code / description / quantity / unit) → matches them against your Catalogue + approved Price List → matched lines go to the Quote Draft sheet (one-click Excel download) → uncertain lines go to a Review Queue → Telegram review alert, or a quote email to the reviewer when everything matched.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credential + one spreadsheet with 5 tabs (see guide)\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n- SMTP credentials for the quote email\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `EXTRACTED` → `MATCHED` → `QUOTED` / `REVIEW_NEEDED` → `SENT`\n\n**Hard rules:** prices come ONLY from the approved Price List — never from the AI. Uncertain matches are flagged for human review, never auto-substituted.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 6060,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "30274a08-7e83-4ebd-ad4a-53fcbbc38907",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — RFQ intake\nForm Trigger (RFQ PDF upload + customer fields) → Extract from File pulls the PDF text → Prepare RFQ Record builds the RFQ reference → RFQ Log row appended with status `NEW`.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c39b10ee-6ea1-407c-9bc1-8db879c38862",
